# License

This repository is mixed-license. The file-level SPDX header is the authoritative license for each source file.

The code falls into four main provenance groups:

- Linux or U-Boot derived code, under GPL-family SPDX headers:
	`genet.device/src/bcmgenet.c`, `genet.device/src/bcmgenet-tx.c`, `genet.device/src/bcmgenet-irq.c`, `genet.device/src/phy.c`, `genet.device/src/phy_interface.c`, and the imported hardware headers under `genet.device/include/genet/` such as `bcmgenet-irq.h`, `bcmgenet-regs.h`, `ethtool.h`, `mii.h`, `phy.h`, `phy_interface.h`, and `unimac.h`.

- Amiga device scaffolding that resembles generic AmigaOS device drivers and also WiFiPi more specifically, kept on the cautious dual-license track:
	`genet.device/src/device.c`, `device_end.c`, `unit.c`, `unit_task.c`, `netdev_api.c`, `bcmgenet-mib.c`, and `genet.device/include/device.h` (with `genet.device/include/genet/bcmgenet-mib.h`).
	These files use `MPL-2.0 OR GPL-2.0+`.

- Original repository files, licensed `GPL-2.0+`:
	`genet.device/src/devtree_parse.c`, `genet.device/include/genet/bcmgenet.h`, and everything under `runtime-config/`.

When redistributing or modifying this repository, follow the SPDX header or original notice on each file you use.